  "description": "KIFDEI crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C50 H72 Nd4 O22. From the CIF bond table, Nd1 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd2 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd2B (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd1B (Nd) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.829-4.045 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.49-113.28°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Nd4(μ3-OH)2(μ2,μ1-acac)6(acac)4]. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula). Article name explicitly identifies I(II).",
